    sa: ["What is a disciple according to Scripture?", ["learner", "follow", "obey", "jesus", "love", "like"], "A good answer says a disciple is a learner and follower of Jesus who trusts and obeys him, abides in his word, is being made like him, shows love and bears fruit."],
